<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>okizari ni shita omoi wo</b></font></font></font>

16
00:00:36,510 --> 00:00:39,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>of the feelings abandoned within the flows of time</b></font></font></font>

17
00:00:39,470 --> 00:00:44,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>wasureta koto sura wasurete ita</b></font></font></font>

18
00:00:39,470 --> 00:00:44,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>have also been lost</b></font></font></font>

19
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:51,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>kuzure kaketa toki kodoku wo shitte</b></font></font></font>

20
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:51,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>when sinking down we learned loneliness</b></font></font></font>

21
00:00:51,110 --> 00:00:55,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>deaeta bokura hitori ja nai</b></font></font></font>

22
00:00:51,110 --> 00:00:55,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>but now we've met each other we are no longer alone</b></font></font></font>

23
00:00:55,860 --> 00:01:01,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>sarake dase kanjou wo banjou no omoi wo</b></font></font></font>

24
00:00:55,860 --> 00:01:01,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>unveil your feelings those high emotions</b></font></font></font>

25
00:01:01,450 --> 00:01:06,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>namidame ga unmei wo kaete yuku</b></font></font></font>

26
00:01:01,450 --> 00:01:06,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>those tears will change your fate</b></font></font></font>

27
00:01:06,870 --> 00:01:09,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>yami ni uchi narase kodou wo</b></font></font></font>

28
00:01:06,870 --> 00:01:09,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>pound your heartbeat against the darkness</b></font></font></font>

29
00:01:09,790 --> 00:01:18,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>kitto aeru yo onaji itami no hata no moto de</b></font></font></font>

30
00:01:09,790 --> 00:01:18,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>we're sure to meet under the same flag of pain</b></font></font></font>

31
00:01:44,250 --> 00:01:45,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A coup d'etat at the Land of Green?</font>

32
00:01:46,620 --> 00:01:48,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, it seems there's no mistake.</font>

33
00:01:48,960 --> 00:01:51,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The retainers conspired
with some men</font>

34
00:01:51,250 --> 00:01:52,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and began a rebellion.</font>

35
00:01:53,250 --> 00:01:54,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What happened to Naruto
and the others?</font>

36
00:01:54,840 --> 00:01:56,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Speculating from their gathering point,</font>

37
00:01:56,920 --> 00:01:58,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">they are around here.</font>

38
00:01:59,590 --> 00:02:01,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, they've already crossed the border.</font>

39
00:02:02,310 --> 00:02:06,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The large countries have agreed
to make this a demilitarized zone.</font>

40
00:02:06,140 --> 00:02:08,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Considering Naruto
and the other's mission,</font>

41
00:02:08,270 --> 00:02:10,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">they should be in a safe area.</font>

42
00:02:11,560 --> 00:02:12,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you sure?</font>

43
00:02:13,360 --> 00:02:15,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you mean?</font>

44
00:02:15,690 --> 00:02:17,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't you think
the timing of this request</font>

45
00:02:18,030 --> 00:02:20,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">strangely overlaps with the coup d'etat?</font>

46
00:02:21,450 --> 00:02:25,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then you're saying that Naruto's mission
is also related to this case?</font>

47
00:02:25,620 --> 00:02:27,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There is a possibility.</font>

48
00:02:27,620 --> 00:02:30,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But there's no time to deal
with Naruto at the moment.</font>

49
00:02:31,250 --> 00:02:32,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We have to take back
the Land of Green</font>

50
00:02:33,040 --> 00:02:34,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">from the rebels as soon as possible.</font>

51
00:02:35,420 --> 00:02:36,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we leave it like this,</font>

52
00:02:36,920 --> 00:02:39,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the flames of the war will
eventually reach other countries.</font>

53
00:02:39,590 --> 00:02:40,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">True.</font>

54
00:02:40,680 --> 00:02:43,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shizune, gather the free villagers</font>

55
00:02:43,550 --> 00:02:45,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and have them head
to the Land of Green immediately!</font>

56
00:02:45,930 --> 00:02:46,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, ma'am!</font>

57
00:02:47,680 --> 00:02:51,980
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">The Byakugan Saw It!</font>

58
00:02:47,680 --> 00:02:51,980
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">The blind Spot of the Magnet User</font>

59
00:03:01,570 --> 00:03:03,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've done it now!</font>

60
00:03:03,910 --> 00:03:05,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What a persistent brat!</font>

61
00:03:10,160 --> 00:03:11,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You shouldn't be able to stand anymore.</font>

62
00:03:11,580 --> 00:03:12,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

63
00:03:14,710 --> 00:03:16,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is nothing.</font>

64
00:03:16,500 --> 00:03:20,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What a surprise... You got some guts.</font>

65
00:03:20,220 --> 00:03:21,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then, take this, too!</font>

66
00:03:22,430 --> 00:03:24,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja Art Magnet!
Electromagnetic Illusion.</font>

67
00:03:35,860 --> 00:03:37,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

68
00:03:37,530 --> 00:03:40,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's useless!
Your voice can't reach him!</font>

69
00:03:41,570 --> 00:03:42,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The human brain functions by</font>

70
00:03:42,910 --> 00:03:44,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">a faint electric current
running through it.</font>

71
00:03:45,160 --> 00:03:46,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you receive
my magnetic force powder,</font>

72
00:03:47,030 --> 00:03:49,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it's going to alter your electric current
and stop your thinking.</font>

73
00:03:53,620 --> 00:03:56,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That chain also has
a strong magnetic force.</font>

74
00:03:56,750 --> 00:03:58,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now, get buried!</font>

75
00:04:01,300 --> 00:04:02,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

76
00:04:10,730 --> 00:04:11,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you okay?</font>

77
00:04:20,820 --> 00:04:21,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank goodness.</font>

78
00:04:22,150 --> 00:04:25,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata... run!</font>

79
00:04:27,200 --> 00:04:28,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't leave you behind.</font>

80
00:04:28,450 --> 00:04:29,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He is...</font>

81
00:04:29,620 --> 00:04:32,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's someone
that you can't deal with.</font>

82
00:04:36,290 --> 00:04:38,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, I promise I'll save you!</font>

83
00:04:39,210 --> 00:04:40,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata!</font>

84
00:04:44,630 --> 00:04:47,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll have you tell me
where that girl is!</font>

85
00:04:47,970 --> 00:04:48,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Byakugan!</font>

86
00:04:49,970 --> 00:04:52,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take this!
Electromagnetic Illusion!</font>

87
00:04:53,850 --> 00:04:56,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Protective 8 Trigrams 64 Palms!</font>

88
00:05:08,950 --> 00:05:09,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

89
00:05:20,130 --> 00:05:23,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see, so that is the Byakugan
of the Village Hidden in Leaves.</font>

90
00:05:24,170 --> 00:05:25,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How interesting!</font>

91
00:05:25,470 --> 00:05:27,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What wonderful Taijutsu, but...</font>

92
00:05:27,470 --> 00:05:30,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll crush it with my power!</font>

93
00:05:43,990 --> 00:05:45,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I did it...?</font>

94
00:05:45,820 --> 00:05:50,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, right.
That level of Taijutsu will not work!</font>

95
00:06:05,380 --> 00:06:06,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's useless.</font>

96
00:06:12,720 --> 00:06:14,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is bad.</font>

97
00:06:30,240 --> 00:06:33,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're not much of a challenge.
I'm disappointed.</font>

98
00:06:34,200 --> 00:06:38,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now, tell me,
where did you hide that girl?</font>

99
00:06:39,750 --> 00:06:43,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you answer me, I'll let you live.
That boy, too.</font>

100
00:06:44,300 --> 00:06:46,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you rescue him right now,
he won't die.</font>

101
00:06:49,050 --> 00:06:51,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Run... Hinata.</font>

102
00:06:51,680 --> 00:06:53,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now say it!</font>

103
00:06:55,560 --> 00:06:58,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You don't want to save that boy?</font>

104
00:06:58,730 --> 00:07:02,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Or do you think you can beat me?</font>

105
00:07:02,650 --> 00:07:06,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I say it,
Naruto would never forgive me.</font>

106
00:07:08,030 --> 00:07:10,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then I'll force you to talk!</font>

107
00:07:15,200 --> 00:07:18,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll change the area behind you
into a powerful magnet.</font>

108
00:07:18,700 --> 00:07:22,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can change the position of the magnet
according to your movement.</font>

109
00:07:22,080 --> 00:07:23,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, it's a waste to run away!</font>

110
00:07:34,760 --> 00:07:36,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That brat...</font>

111
00:07:36,220 --> 00:07:38,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She evaded the attack by throwing
a paper bomb at that very instant.</font>

112
00:07:38,520 --> 00:07:40,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She's pretty quick-witted.</font>

113
00:07:45,520 --> 00:07:46,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

114
00:07:49,490 --> 00:07:50,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't let you go!</font>

115
00:08:00,910 --> 00:08:02,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata.</font>

116
00:08:04,040 --> 00:08:07,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, I promise
that I'll return to rescue you!</font>

117
00:08:11,130 --> 00:08:14,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But there is a huge difference
in power between him and me.</font>

118
00:08:15,590 --> 00:08:17,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I could never beat him!</font>

119
00:08:29,320 --> 00:08:31,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's already caught up to me.
What should I do?</font>

120
00:08:37,450 --> 00:08:41,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is... iron sand?</font>

121
00:08:44,620 --> 00:08:47,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see, his Jutsu can change his body</font>

122
00:08:47,750 --> 00:08:49,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and the things he touches
into magnets.</font>

123
00:08:53,130 --> 00:08:55,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The reason why he didn't attack
back there</font>

124
00:08:55,090 --> 00:08:57,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">was to brush off the iron sand
from his body.</font>

125
00:08:58,260 --> 00:09:01,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If he doesn't,
he would sink right into it.</font>

126
00:09:02,850 --> 00:09:05,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His attack pattern consists
of alternating between</font>

127
00:09:05,600 --> 00:09:07,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja Art Magnet
and Iron Sand Genjutsu.</font>

128
00:09:08,060 --> 00:09:10,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He does this to turn
his magnet powers on and off,</font>

129
00:09:10,520 --> 00:09:12,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so his body won't completely turn
into a magnet.</font>

130
00:09:14,110 --> 00:09:17,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then, there is a way to beat him!</font>

131
00:09:19,450 --> 00:09:22,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now, playtime is almost over!</font>

132
00:09:24,830 --> 00:09:27,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's time you give up now!</font>

133
00:09:28,080 --> 00:09:29,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will never give up!</font>

134
00:09:30,250 --> 00:09:32,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because that is my Ninja Way!</font>

135
00:09:33,510 --> 00:09:34,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What a waste.</font>

136
00:09:34,920 --> 00:09:36,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How dare you do that to Naruto!</font>

137
00:09:36,550 --> 00:09:38,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will definitely not forgive you!</font>

138
00:09:39,470 --> 00:09:41,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Once you say where that girl is,</font>

139
00:09:41,720 --> 00:09:43,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">why don't you live
with that brat in hell!</font>

140
00:09:52,020 --> 00:09:54,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, don't be shy and come closer!</font>

141
00:09:56,070 --> 00:09:57,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right now!</font>

142
00:09:57,150 --> 00:09:58,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll risk everything
in this single attack!</font>

143
00:10:10,210 --> 00:10:11,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">An attack that didn't work before</font>

144
00:10:11,750 --> 00:10:13,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">will never work!</font>

145
00:10:16,840 --> 00:10:18,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that right?</font>

146
00:10:24,850 --> 00:10:26,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

147
00:10:29,350 --> 00:10:33,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're both going to hell!</font>

148
00:10:41,820 --> 00:10:43,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let go, you!</font>

149
00:10:52,920 --> 00:10:55,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You brat! How dare you play
around with me!</font>

150
00:10:56,050 --> 00:10:59,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I changed my mind.
I'll finish you off now!</font>

151
00:11:07,310 --> 00:11:08,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is this?!</font>

152
00:11:10,060 --> 00:11:12,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just now...
I struck a Chakra Point</font>

153
00:11:12,690 --> 00:11:16,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that would make
your Chakra flow go out of control.</font>

154
00:11:18,650 --> 00:11:23,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now your body will turn
into a strong magnet.</font>

155
00:11:24,200 --> 00:11:27,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What...? That's why you brought me
to this sandy area?!</font>

156
00:11:29,290 --> 00:11:30,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop!</font>

157
00:11:34,460 --> 00:11:38,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I did it... Naruto.</font>

158
00:11:57,320 --> 00:12:00,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn! I can't move!</font>

159
00:12:00,820 --> 00:12:02,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Human Boulder!</font>

160
00:12:10,040 --> 00:12:11,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

161
00:12:16,290 --> 00:12:17,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Choji!</font>

162
00:12:19,960 --> 00:12:21,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you okay, Naruto?</font>

163
00:12:21,970 --> 00:12:24,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thanks, Yurinojou.</font>

164
00:12:24,180 --> 00:12:26,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, what happened?</font>

165
00:12:26,550 --> 00:12:30,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The second Janin attacked
and beat me up.</font>

166
00:12:30,600 --> 00:12:32,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What happened to Hinata
and the princess?</font>

167
00:12:32,480 --> 00:12:34,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, yeah! I can't stay here!</font>

168
00:12:35,230 --> 00:12:37,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What...?
What's going on, Naruto?</font>

169
00:12:37,770 --> 00:12:39,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata is in danger!</font>

170
00:12:39,530 --> 00:12:40,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Oh, Naruto!
— Naruto!</font>

171
00:12:56,000 --> 00:12:57,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata!</font>

172
00:13:08,550 --> 00:13:10,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you okay, Hinata?</font>

173
00:13:11,430 --> 00:13:13,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hang in there, Hinata!</font>

174
00:13:15,350 --> 00:13:18,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto... Choji...</font>

175
00:13:19,820 --> 00:13:21,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yurinojou...</font>

176
00:13:23,400 --> 00:13:26,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys...
You guys came to my rescue.</font>

177
00:13:26,700 --> 00:13:30,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Of course. We're friends, right?!</font>

178
00:13:31,580 --> 00:13:32,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes.</font>

179
00:13:32,910 --> 00:13:36,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">By the way, that magnet guy...
Where did he go?</font>

180
00:13:37,040 --> 00:13:40,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He probably sank into the sand.</font>

181
00:13:40,340 --> 00:13:43,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?! You did it, Hinata?!</font>

182
00:13:44,760 --> 00:13:48,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah... I did my best.</font>

183
00:13:48,550 --> 00:13:50,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata, you're great.</font>

184
00:13:50,970 --> 00:13:52,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The guy that I couldn't handle...</font>

185
00:13:54,220 --> 00:13:57,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're complimenting me?</font>

186
00:13:59,360 --> 00:14:00,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto.</font>

187
00:14:00,520 --> 00:14:01,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here.</font>

188
00:14:01,770 --> 00:14:03,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is my forehead band?</font>

189
00:14:06,320 --> 00:14:08,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The mission is not over yet.</font>

190
00:14:09,200 --> 00:14:12,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, please protect the princess...
Princess Haruna.</font>

191
00:14:12,950 --> 00:14:14,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata...</font>

192
00:14:18,080 --> 00:14:19,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I promise you!</font>

193
00:14:19,790 --> 00:14:23,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I swear on this forehead band,
I will definitely protect the princess!</font>

194
00:14:24,550 --> 00:14:25,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And...</font>

195
00:14:26,720 --> 00:14:28,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't be losing against you!</font>

196
00:14:29,930 --> 00:14:31,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto.</font>

197
00:14:31,850 --> 00:14:35,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Look after Hinata, Choji. Yurinojou!</font>

198
00:14:36,180 --> 00:14:37,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right!</font>

199
00:14:37,230 --> 00:14:38,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leave it to us, Naruto!</font>

200
00:14:50,160 --> 00:14:51,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, I'll be damned.</font>

201
00:14:51,990 --> 00:14:55,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't believe that Ruiga
and Jiga were both defeated.</font>

202
00:14:57,620 --> 00:15:00,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, that saves some trouble though.</font>

203
00:15:05,960 --> 00:15:09,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nobody has ever escaped
from my Jutsu.</font>

204
00:15:10,010 --> 00:15:12,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Today will be a good day.</font>

205
00:15:16,810 --> 00:15:18,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Haruna! Where are you?!</font>

206
00:15:27,900 --> 00:15:28,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There she is!</font>

207
00:15:30,530 --> 00:15:32,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Haruna! Get ahold of yourself!</font>

208
00:15:37,080 --> 00:15:38,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you okay?</font>

209
00:15:44,790 --> 00:15:46,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm glad.</font>

210
00:15:49,090 --> 00:15:51,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's me, Princess Haruna!</font>

211
00:15:51,630 --> 00:15:53,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto.</font>

212
00:15:53,800 --> 00:15:55,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I came to rescue you,</font>

213
00:15:55,510 --> 00:15:56,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but what is this treatment?</font>

214
00:15:57,390 --> 00:15:58,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry.</font>

215
00:15:59,810 --> 00:16:02,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why did you escape by yourself?</font>

216
00:16:03,060 --> 00:16:05,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't count on you guys.</font>

217
00:16:07,270 --> 00:16:11,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will try to survive,
no matter who's sacrificed.</font>

218
00:16:12,150 --> 00:16:15,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As long as I survive,
the Land of Green can be revived.</font>

219
00:16:16,870 --> 00:16:18,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's the most important thing, right?!</font>

220
00:16:19,870 --> 00:16:21,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am a victim!</font>

221
00:16:21,750 --> 00:16:25,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I declare that, other countries will
lend me their power.</font>

222
00:16:26,080 --> 00:16:27,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I take back the country and...</font>

223
00:16:27,500 --> 00:16:30,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I, the true successor,
become the feudal lord,</font>

224
00:16:30,590 --> 00:16:32,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">then people will definitely gather</font>

225
00:16:32,550 --> 00:16:34,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and the Land of Green will return
to the way it was!</font>

226
00:16:35,300 --> 00:16:38,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't think so.</font>

227
00:16:38,850 --> 00:16:41,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're saying
that the Land of Green won't revive?!</font>

228
00:16:42,060 --> 00:16:44,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not saying that.</font>

229
00:16:44,850 --> 00:16:49,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I just thought, what if I lived
in the Land of Green...?</font>

230
00:16:51,320 --> 00:16:54,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I was a Ninja just like Yurinojou...?</font>

231
00:16:59,410 --> 00:17:03,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't guard a feudal lord like you.</font>

232
00:17:04,500 --> 00:17:05,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

233
00:17:05,790 --> 00:17:08,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you know?!
What do you know about me?!</font>

234
00:17:09,250 --> 00:17:13,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you know about my life
as a hostage?!</font>

235
00:17:14,220 --> 00:17:16,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Under watch 24-7,</font>

236
00:17:16,550 --> 00:17:19,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">not even allowed to have
my own free time.</font>

237
00:17:19,430 --> 00:17:21,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was lonely everyday.</font>

238
00:17:24,180 --> 00:17:25,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because of that lifestyle,</font>

239
00:17:25,730 --> 00:17:27,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I became sick and was in bed
for a long time.</font>

240
00:17:28,020 --> 00:17:31,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was finally able to return home
after being close to dying.</font>

241
00:17:32,730 --> 00:17:36,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto! If you're saying
that I'm wrong, then answer me!</font>

242
00:17:37,450 --> 00:17:39,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Were the things done to me</font>

243
00:17:39,320 --> 00:17:41,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in the name of protecting
the Land of Green all wrong?!</font>

244
00:17:42,240 --> 00:17:46,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then why did my father and mother
send me away as a hostage?!</font>

245
00:17:47,620 --> 00:17:50,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Answer me! Naruto!</font>

246
00:17:58,390 --> 00:18:00,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't count on you.</font>

247
00:18:02,100 --> 00:18:03,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will go by myself.</font>

248
00:18:04,600 --> 00:18:07,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait. I will go, too.</font>

249
00:18:09,310 --> 00:18:13,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I promised Hinata that I will
definitely protect you, princess.</font>

250
00:18:16,320 --> 00:18:17,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With Hinata...?</font>

251
00:18:19,570 --> 00:18:22,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She fought with the second Janin</font>

252
00:18:22,580 --> 00:18:23,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and got hurt badly.</font>

253
00:18:23,700 --> 00:18:24,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata did...?</font>

254
00:18:25,830 --> 00:18:30,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys said that you didn't accept
the mission of protecting me.</font>

255
00:18:30,960 --> 00:18:33,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then, why do you concern yourselves
with me?</font>

256
00:18:33,130 --> 00:18:34,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I...</font>

257
00:18:35,010 --> 00:18:37,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not only me,
but Hinata and Choji, too.</font>

258
00:18:38,180 --> 00:18:42,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We don't like it when somebody
before us is hurt or sad. That's all.</font>

259
00:18:46,100 --> 00:18:47,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, let's go!</font>

260
00:18:47,980 --> 00:18:50,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we pass through the valley ahead of us,
we'll get to the town.</font>

261
00:18:50,980 --> 00:18:54,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we do that, they probably won't
chase us all the way there!</font>

262
00:19:08,790 --> 00:19:10,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please be careful.</font>

263
00:19:10,370 --> 00:19:12,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No one uses this deer path.</font>

264
00:19:13,040 --> 00:19:15,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This should shake them.</font>

265
00:19:28,230 --> 00:19:30,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I found you!</font>

266
00:19:30,770 --> 00:19:35,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's impossible...
to run away from me!</font>

267
00:19:41,030 --> 00:19:42,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Choji?!</font>

268
00:19:42,660 --> 00:19:44,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't make useless efforts.</font>

269
00:19:45,580 --> 00:19:47,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll make you guys my hostages!</font>

270
00:19:50,120 --> 00:19:52,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys take them back to the castle!</font>

271
00:19:52,750 --> 00:19:53,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes!</font>

272
00:19:55,210 --> 00:19:57,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you wander around me,</font>

273
00:19:57,550 --> 00:20:00,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you might get caught
in my Jutsu and die.</font>

274
00:20:19,110 --> 00:20:21,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's it. We're almost there!</font>

275
00:20:26,990 --> 00:20:29,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no time to waste! Let's go!</font>

276
00:20:29,910 --> 00:20:30,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay!</font>

277
00:20:33,120 --> 00:20:34,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Haruna!</font>

278
00:20:35,170 --> 00:20:36,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm okay!</font>

279
00:20:37,790 --> 00:20:38,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, no!</font>

280
00:20:42,970 --> 00:20:44,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is this?!</font>

281
00:20:44,550 --> 00:20:49,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see, you have good sense
to dodge that attack!</font>

282
00:20:49,770 --> 00:20:51,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who is it?! Where are you?!</font>

283
00:20:53,100 --> 00:20:54,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here, over here!</font>

284
00:20:56,020 --> 00:20:59,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Too bad, but you guys won't be able
to reach that village.</font>

285
00:21:00,650 --> 00:21:03,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Since you guys are going to die here!</font>

286
